@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction

component "SimulationGraphController" as API
component "DistributedSimulationLauncher" as Launcher

queue "Kafka Topic: operation-batches\nkey = routeId\npartitions = N" as OpTopic
queue "Kafka Topic: worker-results\nkey = batchId\npartitions = N" as ResultTopic
queue "Kafka Topic: telemetry-events\nkey = simulationId" as TelemetryTopic

component "Worker Node(s)" as Worker
component "Finish Consumer" as Consumer

API --> Launcher

Launcher --> OpTopic : produce batch tasks

OpTopic --> Worker : consume (partitioned by routeId)

Worker --> ResultTopic : processed results

ResultTopic --> Consumer : consume results

Consumer --> TelemetryTopic : aggregated telemetry
@enduml